# Deep Research Prompt for AI Knowledge Base

## Objective

Create a comprehensive, enterprise-grade AI knowledge base by performing deep research on every question contained in the provided Markdown (`.md`) FAQ file.

Treat the Markdown file as the single source of truth. Do not modify, remove, merge, or reorder the questions.

Your goal is to produce a publication-ready knowledge base that can be directly used for:

* Enterprise training programs
* eLearning content
* AI literacy programs
* AI governance training
* Responsible AI certification
* Instructor-led workshops
* AI playbooks
* Executive awareness programs
* Internal knowledge portals
* AI policy documentation

